Who wouldn’t like to be a princess, at least for one day? Her Majesty, the carriage is ready!

We created a completely new edition of our Crazyfingers app series, enriched with many wonderful features!

Intuitiveness and simplicity are the same as before but younger child will find many new features to have fun alone or with mom and dad.

The app features are:
 • colors palette: 10 colors to choose from, feel free to use your creativity or choose the rainbow button to use the original colors, the white color is the “rubber”. It is possible to choose the brush size to be fast when coloring big surfaces or to paint little details;
 • special paint palette: choose from various funny shapes to create originals and uniques drawings of from some animated stickers to bring drawings alive;
 • each picture can be printed in such a way that it can also be coloured on paper;
 • good choice of original and funny drawings;
 • possibility of turning background music on and off;
 • eye - hand coordination;
 • fun and easy to use and play, just move the finger on the drawing!

Welcome on the world of princesses and have fun with the royal companionship. We present you Her majesty Princess Of Pencils, from a planet far far away arrived Her majesty Princess Of Space and you could also meet a true Princess Of Woodland… but we cannot unveil every secret: discover them by yourself!

We wish you to have fun with our Princesses!
